WEBVTT

00:17:30.006 --> 00:17:33.199
So the teacher's time is further saved.

00:17:33.655 --> 00:17:38.314
Because the routine parts of giving
homework and exams and grading them

00:17:38.338 --> 00:17:41.123
are done by AI.

00:17:41.147 --> 00:17:47.044
And furthermore, we now have records
of students' exam and test scores,

00:17:47.068 --> 00:17:50.941
so the parents or the students
who want more drills

00:17:50.965 --> 00:17:53.140
can do more homework,

00:17:53.164 --> 00:17:56.029
and focus on areas in which they're weak.

00:17:56.053 --> 00:17:59.529
So all of this takes away
the routine work from the teachers,

00:17:59.553 --> 00:18:03.641
so the teachers can focus
on the mentoring and the relationship